{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "canvas-header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 3100,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# \ud83c\udff0 Clash of Clans TH18 Deep RL \u2014 Model Architecture & Training Tracker\n\nThis canvas dynamically tracks our neural network architectures, spatial observation tensors, action spaces, reward formulations, and empirical training performance across Town Hall 18 meta compositions and reference villages.\n\n- **Primary Evolution**: Transition from **v1.0 (8-Channel, 1x Single-Deploy)** to **v2.0 (10-Channel Tactical Archetypes & Batch-Deploy Fractions)**.\n- **Resumed Training Recognition**: Automatically merges subsequent training sessions (e.g. $10{,}000\\text{ ep} + 5{,}000\\text{ ep} = 15{,}000\\text{ total ep}$), tracking cumulative experience and updating performance matrices in real time.\n- **Main Performance Metric**: Complete $3 \\times 5$ deterministic evaluation matrix of each TH18 Meta Composition vs each Reference Village.\n- **Vault Documentation**: [[00_Index_MOC|Vault Map of Content]] \u2022 [[encodings/Unit_Type_Spatial_Encoding|Tactical Archetype Encoding Spec]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-v1_baseline_8ch",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 3480,
      "color": "1",
      "label": "Model Section: v1.0 \u2014 Baseline 8-Channel Single-Deploy (30,102 Cumulative Episodes \u2014 SUPERSEDED)"
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-overview",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Run Overview & Resumption Lineage\n- **Model Name**: **v1.0 \u2014 Baseline 8-Channel Single-Deploy**\n- **Architecture**: `v1.0` (8 Spatial Channels)\n- **Status**: **SUPERSEDED**\n- **Total Training Episodes**: **`30,102`** (Cumulative)\n- **Peak Record**: **`100%` (3\u2605)** (Return: `+101.75`)\n- **Latest Checkpoint**: `trained_models/attacker_ep30102_100pct_3star.pt`\n\n#### \ud83d\udd04 Resumed Training Sessions (6 Total)\n| Session | Episode Range | Delta | Peak Result |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Session #1** | `0 -> 2,400` | `+2,400 ep` | `86% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #2** | `2,400 -> 3,824` | `+1,424 ep` | `86% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #3** | `3,824 -> 6,514` | `+2,690 ep` | `87% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #4** | `6,514 -> 10,208` | `+3,694 ep` | `97% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #5** | `10,208 -> 15,216` | `+5,008 ep` | `97% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #6** | `15,216 -> 30,102` | `+14,886 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n\n> **Resumption Rule**: When training resumes from this model, its card automatically updates with cumulative episodes (**30,102**) and re-evaluates the latest weights across all matchups."
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-inputs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udce5 Input Observation Space\n- **Spatial Grid Tensor**: **`(B, 8, 50, 50)`**\n- **Army Context Vector**: **`(B, 64)`** (remaining troop counts, heroes, abilities, sieges, spells)\n\n| Ch | Feature Name | Normalization |\n| :-: | :--- | :--- |\n| `0` | **Building HP Ratio** | `hp / max_hp across footprint` |\n| `1` | **Defense DPS Threat** | `min(DPS / 1000, 1.0)` |\n| `2` | **Town Hall 18 Mask** | `1.0 on TH18 tiles, 0.0 elsewhere` |\n| `3` | **Wall Integrity** | `wall_hp / max_wall_hp` |\n| `4` | **No-Deploy Red Zone** | `1.0 = forbidden, 0.0 = legal deploy` |\n| `5` | **Friendly Ground HP** | `min(sum(HP_ground) / 5000, 1.0)` |\n| `6` | **Friendly Air HP** | `min(sum(HP_air) / 5000, 1.0)` |\n| `7` | **Active Spell Field** | `min(remaining_ticks / 300, 1.0)` |\n\n*Preserves exact 1-to-1 tile spatial resolution without destructive downsampling.*"
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-outputs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udce4 Output Policy & Critic Heads\nFactorized Multi-Discrete Action Space:\n- **Head 1**: `slot_type (7)`\n- **Head 2**: `slot_idx (10)`\n- **Head 3**: `tile_xy (2500)`\n- **Head 4**: `critic_value (1)`\n- **Critic Head**: `Linear(256 -> 1)` scalar state-value estimate $V(s) \\in \\mathbb{R}$.\n\n#### Deployment Dynamics:\n- **v1.0 Rate**: $1\\times$ unit per step ($0.64\\text{s}$ delay per unit; 14 Throwers took $8.96\\text{s}$).\n- **v2.0 Rate**: Multi-unit wave drop via `deploy_fraction_head` ($\\alpha \\in \\{0.0, 0.25, 0.50, 0.75, 1.00\\}$), dropping full squads in a single $0.64\\text{s}$ step!"
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-reward",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfaf Reward Formulation (TH18 Combat)\n\nBalanced 50/50 weighting between **Destruction Percentage** and **Milestone Victory Stars**:\n\n$$R_t = 0.50 \\cdot \\Delta \\%_{\\text{destr}} + 16.6667 \\cdot \\Delta \\text{stars} - 0.05 \\cdot \\mathbb{I}_{\\text{invalid}}$$\n\n- **Destruction**: $0.50\\text{ pts}$ per $1\\%$ building destruction ($50.0\\text{ pts}$ max).\n- **Victory Stars**: $\\frac{50.0}{3} = 16.6667\\text{ pts}$ per star earned ($50.0\\text{ pts}$ max for 3 stars).\n- **Invalid Penalty**: $-0.05\\text{ pts}$ deducted for executing illegal actions (e.g. dropping in red zone).\n- **Total Wipe Return**: A complete $100\\%$ 3-star wipe achieves **$100.0\\text{ base reward}$**.\n- **Fast-Forward Bonus**: When active attack actions are exhausted or timer reaches limit, remaining simulation ticks run to resolution and award accrued terminal rewards."
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-arch-img",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "assets/architectures/v1_architecture.png",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 480
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-results-matrix",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 1650,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### \u2694\ufe0f Main Performance Metric: Army Compositions vs. Reference Villages\n\nDeterministic rollout benchmarks evaluated across all 3 Meta Compositions against all 5 Reference TH18 Base Layouts:\n\n| Attack Composition | **Central Box** | **Offset Diamond** | **Anti-Hydra Ring** | **Anti-Fireball** | **Compact Teaser** | **Avg Destruction** | **3\u2605 Rate** |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **TH18 Thrower + Healer + Totem Smash** | `72% (1\u2605)` | `68% (2\u2605)` | `66% (1\u2605)` | `69% (1\u2605)` | `67% (2\u2605)` | **68.4%** | **0.0%** |\n| **TH18 Dragon Duke Charge Hydra** | `44% (0\u2605)` | `57% (1\u2605)` | `59% (1\u2605)` | `63% (1\u2605)` | `66% (2\u2605)` | **57.8%** | **0.0%** |\n| **TH18 Fireball Super Bowler & Meteor Golem Smash** | `60% (1\u2605)` | `51% (2\u2605)` | `58% (1\u2605)` | `54% (1\u2605)` | `59% (2\u2605)` | **56.4%** | **0.0%** |\n| **Base Defense Rate (Avg)** | **58.7% (0.67\u2605)** | **58.7% (1.67\u2605)** | **61.0% (1.0\u2605)** | **62.0% (1.0\u2605)** | **64.0% (2.0\u2605)** | **Overall: 60.9%** | \u2014 |\n\n- **Overall Matchup Average**: **`60.9% Destruction`** with **`1.27\u2605 Average Stars`**.\n- **Model Checkpoint Tested**: `trained_models/attacker_ep30102_100pct_3star.pt`."
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-curves-img",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "assets/charts/v1_baseline_8ch_training_curves.png",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 700
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-hyperparams",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 2870,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### \u2699\ufe0f Hyperparameters & Training Configuration\n\n| Parameter | Configured Value | Tactical Function in PPO |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| **Total Cumulative Episodes** | **`30,102`** | Total combat experience across **6** resumed sessions |\n| **Learning Rate (`lr`)** | `0.0003` | Adam optimizer step size with linear/cosine warmup |\n| **Batch Episodes** | `4` | Number of combat episodes accumulated per PPO policy update |\n| **Minibatch Size** | `64` | Mini-batch sample size for SGD gradient steps |\n| **PPO Epochs (`K`)** | `4` | Number of optimization epochs over each rollout buffer |\n| **Simulation Ticks / Step** | `8` | Combat granularity: `8 ticks` = `0.64s` per agent decision |\n| **Discount Factor ($\\gamma$)** | `0.99` | Long-term return horizon weighting |\n| **GAE Parameter ($\\lambda$)** | `0.95` | Bias-variance tradeoff in advantage estimation |\n| **PPO Clipping ($\\epsilon$)** | `0.2` | Surrogate policy clipping threshold |\n| **Entropy Coefficient** | `0.015` | Exploration incentive preventing early deployment collapse |\n| **Matchup Sampling Mode** | `random` | Sampling distribution across reference compositions and base layouts |"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-v2_archetype_10ch",
