      "width": 700,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Run Overview & Resumption Lineage\n- **Model Name**: **v2.0 \u2014 10-Channel Archetype & Batch-Deploy Fraction**\n- **Architecture**: `v2.0` (10 Spatial Channels)\n- **Status**: **ACTIVE**\n- **Total Training Episodes**: **`5,786`** (Cumulative)\n- **Peak Record**: **`100%` (3\u2605)** (Return: `+127.8575248226292`)\n- **Latest Checkpoint**: `trained_models/attacker_ep5786_100pct_3star.pt`\n\n#### \ud83d\udd04 Resumed Training Sessions (17 Total)\n| Session | Episode Range | Delta | Peak Result |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Session #1** | `0 -> 2,724` | `+2,724 ep` | `84% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #2** | `2,724 -> 2,726` | `+2 ep` | `85% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #3** | `8,770 -> 8,806` | `+36 ep` | `90% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #4** | `8,806 -> 8,866` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #5** | `8,866 -> 8,902` | `+36 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #6** | `8,902 -> 8,962` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #7** | `8,962 -> 9,022` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #8** | `8,770 -> 8,830` | `+60 ep` | `90% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #9** | `30,102 -> 30,162` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #10** | `8,770 -> 8,830` | `+60 ep` | `94% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #11** | `8,770 -> 8,830` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #12** | `8,770 -> 8,830` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #13** | `8,770 -> 8,950` | `+180 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #14** | `8,770 -> 8,878` | `+108 ep` | `98% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #15** | `8,878 -> 8,938` | `+60 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n| **Session #16** | `0 -> 4` | `+4 ep` | `88% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #17** | `0 -> 5,786` | `+5,786 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n\n> **Resumption Rule**: When training resumes from this model, its card automatically updates with cumulative episodes (**5,786**) and re-evaluates the latest weights across all matchups."
    },
    {
      "id": "v2_archetype_10ch-inputs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2360,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udce5 Input Observation Space\n- **Spatial Grid Tensor**: **`(B, 10, 50, 50)`**\n- **Army Context Vector**: **`(B, 64)`** (remaining troop counts, heroes, abilities, sieges, spells)\n\n| Ch | Feature Name | Normalization |\n| :-: | :--- | :--- |\n| `0` | **Building HP Ratio** | `hp / max_hp across footprint` |\n| `1` | **Defense DPS Threat** | `min(DPS / 1000, 1.0)` |\n| `2` | **Town Hall 18 Mask** | `1.0 on TH18 tiles, 0.0 elsewhere` |\n| `3` | **Wall Integrity** | `wall_hp / max_wall_hp` |\n| `4` | **No-Deploy Red Zone** | `1.0 = forbidden, 0.0 = legal deploy` |\n| `5` | **Friendly Ground HP** | `min(sum(HP_ground) / 5000, 1.0)` |\n| `6` | **Friendly Air HP** | `min(sum(HP_air) / 5000, 1.0)` |\n| `7` | **Active Spell Field** | `min(remaining_ticks / 300, 1.0)` |\n| `8` | **Allied Tactical Archetype** | `max phi(u) in [0, 1]` |\n| `9` | **Enemy Tactical Archetype** | `max phi(u) in [0, 1]` |\n\n*Preserves exact 1-to-1 tile spatial resolution without destructive downsampling.*"
    },
